The SplitMix64 RNG, Box-Muller initializer, arithmetic split, sampler and
Rotate90 baseline are adapted from web/own-channel/python/rotate90.py in
https://github.com/fxeqxmulfx/grokking_abmod at revision
f49969393a7482490d45483d8a4fd3046b1adede.

reference.py is an unmodified copy of that export. It is used only as an
independent test reference on the current PyTorch runtime.

